    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Webhook Intake & Validation\n\n- POST `/webhook/support-ticket`\n- Validates: Name, Email (regex), Subject, Message\n- Generates unique Ticket ID (TKT-YYYYMMDD-XXXXX)\n- Returns 400 with error details on validation failure\n- Returns 200 with ticket summary on success"
      },
      "id": "e04b1643-a782-4244-812e-0fd550396d76",
      "name": "Note — Intake",
      "position": [
        -720,
        240
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Attachment Handling (Bonus)\n\n- Checks for binary PDF attachments\n- Extracts text from PDF using built-in extractor\n- `continueOnFail: true` — corrupted/scanned PDFs won't crash the pipeline\n- Appends extracted text to message body\n- Logs extraction success/failure",
        "height": 272
      },
      "id": "8665275e-26e1-4a2c-a81c-f8e00090782b",
      "name": "Note — Attachment",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
