      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Multi-Step AI Processing\n\n**Step 1 — Classification Agent:**\n- Subject + Message → OpenAI (gpt-4o-mini, temp 0.1)\n- Structured JSON output: Category, Urgency, Sentiment, Confidence, Summary\n- Enforced via JSON schema output parser\n\n**Step 2 — RAG Draft Response:**\n- Classification context + customer message → OpenAI (gpt-4.1-mini) with Vector Store Tool\n- Retrieves EXACTLY top-3 chunks from Qdrant (knowledge_base collection)\n- References specific KB articles in the draft\n- If top similarity < 0.45 (or no relevant chunks), include the general-knowledge fallback note",
        "height": 256,
        "width": 624
      },
      "id": "c8b70231-34dd-41c5-ac92-ca2dcc1c3e24",
      "name": "Note — AI Pipeline",
